  <note>
    <title>4000 error시</title>
    <created>20180607T071438Z</created>
    <updated>20180607T071447Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
      <source>desktop.win</source>
      <source-url>
        http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?rs=0&amp;uid=swg21099632&amp;cm_mc_uid=33111412820715283491468&amp;cm_mc_sid_50200000=65252431528353716516
      </source-url>
      <source-application>evernote.win32</source-application>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">네트워크 주소 항목을 통해 서버가 자체에 연결할 수 있는지 확인하려면 추적 명령을 사용할 수 있습니다.</span><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">이를 수행하려면 Domino Administrator를 실행하고 서버 콘솔 창을 열고 Trace &lt;network address&gt; 명령을 실행하십시오.</span><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">서버에 연결되었다고보고해야합니다.</span><span style="border: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(50, 50, 50); font-family: ibm-plex-sans, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;">&nbsp;</span></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
