  <note>
    <title>액티브 x 제거</title>
    <created>20141013T051822Z</created>
    <updated>20141013T054002Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=853934&amp;cid=50371&amp;categoryId=50371</source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">
사장님 말씀
<div><br/></div><div><span style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">윈도&nbsp;</span><a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=840721&amp;amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none; font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">사용자</a><span style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">들이&nbsp;</span><a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=826386&amp;amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none; font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">인터넷</a><span style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">을 쉽고 편리하게 이용하도록&nbsp;</span><a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=848085&amp;amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none; font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">마이크로소프트사</a><span style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">에서 개발한 것으로, 기존의&nbsp;</span><a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=815270&amp;amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none; font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">응용 프로그램</a><span style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">으로 작성된 문서 등을 웹과 연결시켜 그대로 사용할 수 있게 하는 기술</span></div><div><font color="#2F2F2F" face="굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px;"><br/></span></font></div><div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 18px; padding: 0px; position: relative; font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px !important; line-height: 23px !important; color: rgb(47, 47, 47); word-break: break-all; word-wrap: break-word; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">MS</span>가 윈도 사용자들이 기존 응용&nbsp;<a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=2062854&amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none;">프로그램</a>으로 작성한 문서 등을&nbsp;<a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=2062259&amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none;">인터넷</a>과 연결시켜 그대로 사용할 수 있도록 개발한 기술. 예컨대 인터넷 뱅킹을 하려면 금융거래 및 보안 프로그램을 설치한&nbsp;<span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">PC</span>에서만 가능한데 액티브X는 이러한 프로그램을 유포하는 수단이다.&nbsp;<span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">MS</span>의 웹 브라우저인 인터넷 익스플로러(<span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">IE</span>)로 인터넷 사이트에 접속해 서비스를 이용하려 할 때 &apos;이&nbsp;<a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=2074809&amp;amp;amp;ref=y" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none;">소프트웨어</a>를 설치하시겠습니까?&apos;라는 메시지가 나오는데 이것이 대부분 액티브X다. 국내 인터넷 사이트의 대다수가&nbsp;<span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">IE</span>의 액티브X를 기반으로 하고 있어 파이어폭스 등 다른 웹 브라우저로는 정상적으로 인터넷 서비스를 이용하기 어려운 경우가 많다.</p><div style="clear: both; height: 1px; margin: 30px 0px; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(229, 229, 229); font-size: 0px; line-height: 0; color: rgb(75, 75, 75); font-family: 돋움, Dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div><p style="margin: 11px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-family: Dotum; color: black;"><strong style="padding: 0px 7px 0px 0px;">[네이버 지식백과]</strong>&nbsp;<a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=2079525" style="color: rgb(17, 114, 182); text-decoration: none;">액티브X</a>&nbsp;(한경 경제용어사전, 한국경제신문/한경닷컴 )</p></div></div><div style="color: rgb(47, 47, 47); font-family: 굴림, gulim, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 23px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p style="margin: 11px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-family: Dotum; color: black;"><strong style="padding: 0px 7px 0px 0px;">[네이버 지식백과]</strong>&nbsp;<a href="http://terms.naver.com/entry.nhn?docId=853934" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 182); text-decoration: none;">액티브 X</a>&nbsp;[<span style="margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;"><span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">active</span>&nbsp;<span lang="en" style="float: none !important; display: inline !important; margin: 0px !important; padding: 0px !important; border: 0px !important; background-image: none !important; background-position: initial initial !important; background-repeat: initial initial !important;">X</span></span>] (IT용어사전, 한국정보통신기술협회)</p></div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>에이전트 실행 명령어</title>
    <created>20190530T050918Z</created>
    <updated>20190530T081827Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
      <source>desktop.win</source>
      <source-url>http://www-10.lotus.com/ldd/nd6forum.nsf/DateAllFlatWeb/0701622cac9118d285257727004f3453?OpenDocument</source-url>
      <source-application>evernote.win32</source-application>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana, arial, sans-serif;">tell amgr run &lt;데이터베이스&gt; &apos;&lt;에이전트 이름&gt;&apos;</span><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana, arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 8pt; font-family: verdana;">Empno</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 8pt; font-family: verdana;"><br/></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 8pt; font-family: verdana;">tell amgr run &quot;eni/useradmin_c.nsf&quot; &apos;test1&apos;</span></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>에이전트 lock</title>
    <created>20170614T065243Z</created>
    <updated>20170614T065329Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
      <source>desktop.win</source>
      <source-application>evernote.win32</source-application>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; On Error Goto processerror</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &apos;Msgbox note.Query_String_Decoded(0)</div><div><br/></div><div>%REM</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 에이전트 lock 걸기 시작 선언</div><div>%END REM</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Dim lockName As String</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Dim lockID As Integer</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Dim lockOK As Variant</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Dim unlockOK As Variant</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Dim deletelockOK As Variant</div><div><br/></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; lockName = &quot;ReceiveLock&quot;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; lockID = Createlock(&quot;lockName&quot;)</div><div><br/></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; If (lockID = -1) Then&nbsp; &apos;lockid가 없으면 lock을 생성할수 없음.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Print {&lt;Script&gt;alert(&quot;} &amp; Cstr(errornum) &amp; {개의 문서에 오류가 발생했습니다.&quot;)&lt;/Script&gt;}</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &apos;Print {&lt;script&gt;window.location = top.menu_fr.document.all.preview.value;&lt;/script&gt;}</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Exit Sub</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; End If</div><div><br/></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&apos;딴 에이전트가 Unlock할때까지 기둘리다가 lock 한다.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Do</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; lockOK = Codelock(lockID)</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; If (Not lockOK) Then</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sleep 1</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; End If</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Loop Until lockOK</div><div><br/></div><div>%REM&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 에이전트 lock 걸기 끝</div><div>%END REM</div><div><br/></div><div>에러</div><div>processerror:</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; unlockOK = Codeunlock(lockID) &apos; 락을 풀어주고</div><div><br/></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&apos;lock을 다쓰고 나면 최종적으로 destroylock 해야함.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; deletelockOK = Destroylock(lockID) &apos; 락을 완전히 삭제한다. 그래야 다음 사람이 쓸 수 있다.</div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>운영체제에서 사용되는 파일로서 호스트 이름에 대응하는 IP주소가 저장되어 있어서</title>
    <created>20140826T053559Z</created>
    <updated>20140826T053658Z</updated>
    <tag>공부</tag>
    <note-attributes>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">
운영체제에서 사용되는 파일로서 호스트 이름에 대응하는 IP주소가 저장되어 있어서
<div>도메인 이름 시스템에서 주소 정보를 제공받지 않고도 서버의 위치를 찾게 해준다</div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
