  <note>
    <title>웹에서 Notes 보기 데이터를 MS엑셀로 변환하기</title>
    <created>20141215T024944Z</created>
    <updated>20141215T024951Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>
        http://www.techlearning.co.kr/search/label/IBM%20Notes%2FDomino%20%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C?updated-max=2013-02-14T10:10:00%2B09:00&amp;max-results=20&amp;start=321&amp;by-date=false
      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">이번 팁에서는, 웹에서 Notes 보기 데이터를 엑셀로 변환하여 저장하는 방법을 소개합니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1. 보기 속성의&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">보기 정보</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;탭(첫번째 탭) 에서, 보기의 이름 및 별칭을 지정합니다. 별칭의 확장자는 다음 예와 같이&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">.xls</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">로 지정합니다.</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-yIem_T8SaHM/UPjb9WPAMbI/AAAAAAAAAyI/Q6oaDvTGQNw/s1600/20162075665-10.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="622b1f3a7de7dc43760ad45bb8bac7c4" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">2. 보기 속성의&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">고급사항</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;탭 (끝에서 두번째 탭) 에서,&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">웹 접근</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;섹션의&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">보기 내용을 HTML로 처리</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">를 선택합니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-_6w_p6v0wvM/UPjb9aJLLJI/AAAAAAAAAyM/1IaNqjBHD-g/s1600/20162075665-20.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="a6e9f79e052ce12520583ddc77ba2c94" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3. 보기 열에서, 필요한&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">&lt;tr&gt;</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;과&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">&lt;td&gt;</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;표 태그를 추가합니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-dsot6Wjzob4/UPjb9Vhk9AI/AAAAAAAAAyE/HDyYKL3hb3Q/s1600/20162075665-30.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="d7455afb1bbc4139747d9cc3eb4c6744" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4.</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;$$ViewTemplate for viewname</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;형식의 양식을 작성합니다. 양식 속성의&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">기본</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;탭 (두번째 탭) 에서,&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">웹 접근</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;섹션의&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">내용 종류</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">를&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">기타</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">로 선택한 후&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">application/msexcel</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;을 입력합니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-kHGrGLEdT1g/UPjb-KaLOEI/AAAAAAAAAyQ/GC__iJE_fLQ/s1600/20162075665-40.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="9d13792ec5a032775d6c2ff24cd53561" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">5. 보기를 위의 양식에 삽입한 후, 다음 예와 같이 표 시작 및 종료 태그를 추가힙니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ZtgHIX66FN0/UPjb-Xrw6pI/AAAAAAAAAyY/7mJv-rnuWyk/s1600/20162075665-50.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="927196fef46cc5ff3a5a9233864b8b42" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">6. 웹브라우저에서,&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><pre style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
http://server/dbpath/viewname.xls
</pre><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">형식의 URL 을 입력하면, 다음 예와 같이 엑셀 형태로의 열기 및 저장 여부를 묻는 대화상자가 표시됩니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-PZSoe6iULkA/UPjb-V1h2QI/AAAAAAAAAyc/_eL0QVUuxtY/s1600/20162075665-60.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="62285e7f9a74e6dfe538c36a255e7403" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">7. 해당 파일을 저장하는 경우, 다음 예와 같이 보기 데이터가 엑셀 형태로 변환된 것을 확인할 수 있습니다.</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-RvYqL2A7I8I/UPjb_T1bQUI/AAAAAAAAAyo/SDadruFMY9E/s1600/20162075665-70.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="bff8f0d7fb1ef29fe35d63a06b94e055" style="cursor: default;cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a></div></en-note>      ]]>
