  <note>
    <title>응답 문서가 있는 Notes 문서에 대한 삭제 방지</title>
    <created>20141215T012334Z</created>
    <updated>20141215T012336Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>
        http://www.techlearning.co.kr/search/label/IBM%20Notes%2FDomino%20%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C?updated-max=2013-09-09T09:59:00%2B09:00&amp;max-results=20&amp;start=79&amp;by-date=false
      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sub Querydocumentdelete(Source As Notesuidatabase, Continue As Variant)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&apos;** 현재 문서에 대한 처리</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim ns As New NotesSession</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim nDocCurrent As NotesDocument</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim ndcCollection As NotesDocumentCollection</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set ndcCollection = Source.Documents</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set nDocCurrent = ndcCollection.GetFirstDocument</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&apos;** 현재 문서와 관련된 응답 문서가 있는지 조회</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&apos;** 만약 응답 문서가 존재하는 경우 삭제 방지</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim ResponseCollection As NotesDocumentCollection</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set ResponseCollection = nDocCurrent.Responses</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">numDocs&amp; = ResponseCollection.Count &apos;** 응답 문서의 갯수</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If numDocs&amp; &gt; 0 Then</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Messagebox &quot;응답 문서가 있기 때문에 삭제할 수 없습니다&quot;,64,&quot;삭제 취소&quot;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Continue = False</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">End If</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">End Sub</span></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>이관처리 되지 않은 문서는 (접수자)께서 직접 수신문서 이관처리하셔야 합니다.</title>
    <created>20150126T015552Z</created>
    <updated>20150126T015627Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>
        http://gw.nanobrain.co.kr/mail/mcjung.nsf/iNotes/Mail/?OpenDocument&amp;ui=dwa_frame&amp;l=ko&amp;gz&amp;CR&amp;MX&amp;TS=20140811T160049undefined82Z&amp;charset=UTF-8&amp;charset=UTF-8&amp;KIC&amp;ua=ie&amp;pt&amp;gn
      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><br/>
이관처리 되지 않은 문서는 (접수자)께서 직접 수신문서 이관처리하셔야 합니다.
</en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>일정 기간이 경과된 Notes 메일 문서 자동 삭제하기</title>
    <created>20141215T010647Z</created>
    <updated>20141215T010656Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>
        http://www.techlearning.co.kr/search/label/IBM%20Notes%2FDomino%20%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C?updated-max=2013-10-04T01:57:00%2B09:00&amp;max-results=20&amp;start=59&amp;by-date=false
      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sub Initialize</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim s As New NotesSession</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim collection As NotesDocumentCollection</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim db As NotesDatabase</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim docSource As NotesDocument</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim dtNow As NotesDateTime</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim nextDocument As NotesDocument</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim View As NotesView</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set db = s.currentdatabase</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dim Counter As Double</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set dtNow = New NotesDateTime(&quot;&quot;)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">REM 현재 시간/날짜 설정</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">dtNow.SetNow</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">REM 90일전 시간/날짜 설정</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Call dtNow.AdjustDay(-90)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">REM 받은 문서 폴더 지정</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set View = db.GetView(&quot;($Inbox)&quot;)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set docSource = View.GetFirstDocument()</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Counter = 0</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">REM 90일이 지난 메일 문서들을 검색하여 삭제처리</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">While Not(docSource Is Nothing)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set nextDocument = View.GetNextDocument(docSource)</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set dtDelivered = New NotesDateTime(docSource.PostedDate(0))</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If dtNow.TimeDifference(dtDelivered) &gt;0 Then</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">docSource.Remove True</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Counter = Counter + 1</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">End If</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Set docSource = nextDocument</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Wend</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Print counter &amp; &quot;개의 문서들이 받은 문서 폴더에서 삭제되었습니다.&quot;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; color: rgb(102, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">End Sub</span></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
