  <note>
    <title>조직변경</title>
    <created>20141114T125408Z</created>
    <updated>20150521T001306Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">
1.그룹 생성&nbsp;
<div><br/><div>2.웹에서 부서코드 생성</div><div><br/></div><div>2개 합친 조직이면</div><div>부서함을 복사를 해서 덮어씌움</div><div>부서함 acl변경(접근제어)</div></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>조직변경</title>
    <created>20141105T091834Z</created>
    <updated>20141106T015102Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">
1.주소록에 그룹생성<br/>
2.웹관리자로 부서등록(부서코드 중복되지않도록 주의)부사관리 cs참조<br/>
3.구 부서에서 신 부서로 사용자 소속부서 변경(웹)<br/>
4.구 부서함 문서 새로 만든 부서함으로 문서 옮김(admin eni\deptbox) hsmail/hscert<br/>
5. 신규 부서함에 ACL확인(접근제어목록)<br/>
6. 부서함 삭제<br/>
7. 신규그룹 및 사용자 확인()
</en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
  <note>
    <title>지엠비 부서 고문 숨김처리 완료</title>
    <created>20190131T083645Z</created>
    <updated>20190131T083702Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>bbb1sss2@gmail.com</author>
      <source>desktop.win</source>
      <source-application>evernote.win32</source-application>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div><en-media hash="204b400d5dcb3d2e2aae119bee3b1439" type="image/png"/></div><div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
    <resource>
