                        다른 버전
                    </a>
        </div>
        <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;position:relative;overflow:hidden;width:10px;height:10px;margin-top:5px;margin-right:5px;cursor:pointer;float:left;">
          <en-media type="image/png" hash="67220ce22629b5b5e936828216e76390" width="1936" height="52" style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;border:0px;top:-3px;left:-533px;position:absolute;margin:0px;padding:0px;width:auto;height:auto;"></en-media>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;width:1px;height:17px;overflow:hidden;background:url(http://i3.msdn.microsoft.com/Areas/Epx/Content/Images/ImageSprite.png?v=635533092500576233) -525px -3px no-repeat scroll;margin-left:10px;float:left;display:block;"></div><div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;float:left;display:block;font-size:1em;margin:0px 0px 0px 13px;">
        <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(93, 93, 93);">
            이 항목은 아직 평가되지 않았습니다.<span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">- </span><a href="http://msdn.microsoft.com/ko-kr/library/s2dy91zy.aspx#feedback" title="이 항목 평가" style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(19, 100, 196);">이 항목 평가</a>
            
        </span>
    </div></div>
  <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;clear:both;"></div>
  
  <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;clear:both;">
    <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
      <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
        <p style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(42, 42, 42);margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-bottom:15px;line-height:18px;">
          <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">형식 변환 함수는 인라인으로 컴파일됩니다. 이는 변환 코드가 식을 계산하는 코드의 일부임을 의미합니다.</span>
          </span>  <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">경우에 따라 변환을 수행하기 위해 프로시저를 호출할 필요가 없으므로 실행 속도가 빨라집니다.</span></span>  <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">다음의 각 함수는 해당 식을 특정 데이터 형식으로 변환합니다.</span></span>  </p>
      </div>
      <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;min-width:260px;clear:both;">
    <div style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;vertical-align:middle;height:23px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        
    </div>
