                </span>  <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">소스 데이터 형식의 임의 식입니다.</span></span>  </p>
