                      <span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">값의 범위는 0에서 255까지(부호가 없으며 소수 부분은 반올림됨<span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;vertical-align:super;">1</span>)입니다.</span>
