<span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:Green;">&apos; The following line of code sets aDate to a Date value.</span>
