<span style="font-family:&apos;Malgun Gothic&apos;, Gulim, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, &apos;Lucida Grande&apos;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:Green;">&apos; The following line of code sets aDbl to 1.9225456288E+1.</span>
