      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div style="font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em;-en-paragraph:true;"><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space; font-family: &quot;Sans Serif&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;">운영시간에 하기의 명령어를 수행시 사용자에게 서비스 할 수 없음 그래서 반드시 업무시간 외에 처리요망</span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;"><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space; font-family: &quot;Sans Serif&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">1) load fixup -f&nbsp;eni\aprbox_20170330.nsf</span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;"><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space; font-family: &quot;Sans Serif&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">- 수행후 fixup task가 다 종료되면 다음 단계진행(서버 모니터링 하면서 확인)</span></div><div><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">2) load compact -B mail/xxx.nsf</span></div><div><br/></div><div><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">load compact -B domdoc/admn-79d7fy.nsf</span></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div><span style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;">bipex1221</span></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
  </note>
