  <note>
    <title>Domino 8.5.3 의 새로운 IMAP 명령어</title>
    <created>20150513T062951Z</created>
    <updated>20160621T073025Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>http://www.techlearning.co.kr/2013/01/domino-853-imap.html</source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note><div style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><div>화승 rna</div><div><br/></div><div>imap 포트번호: 6001</div><div>smtp 포트번호:6666</div><div><br/></div><div><b><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br/></span></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br/></span></span></span></b></div><div><b><span style="font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br/></span></span></span></b></div><div><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Domino 8.5.3</strong><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;에서는,&nbsp;</span><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IMAP</span></b><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;과 관련하여 다음과 같은 새로운 명령어들을 사용할 수 있습니다.</span></div><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">tell imap show threadpool threads debug</span></b><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">이 명령어는 사용자별 세션 ID와 함께 모든 활성 세션들의 목록을 표시합니다.</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-T8n-6pJd32o/UPjZd0H4uUI/AAAAAAAAAxY/dEndF6BnAns/s1600/20162136557-10.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="d362ae0f8503e0d46791000df7ac48cc" style="cursor: default; height: auto;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">tell imap drop all</strong><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></strong><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">이 명령어는 모든 접속을 해제합니다.</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-59YLUR5s66I/UPjZeIuUhTI/AAAAAAAAAxc/v5dlnnyT1OU/s1600/20162136557-20.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="79ccaaa91132f1a6e58afb81aba8ea62" style="cursor: default; height: auto;" type="image/gif"/></a></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">tell imap drop session 세션 ID</strong><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></strong><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">이 명령어는 특정 세션 ID 의 접속을 해제합니다.</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: 굴림; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br/></span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; clear: both; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-U3R_cpYFjXM/UPjZeFH31EI/AAAAAAAAAxg/uGHwOUn6vKc/s1600/20162136557-30.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="2cbfac7668f8468158400fbd0ce39d33" style="cursor: default; height: auto;" type="image/gif"/></a></div></div></en-note>      ]]>
