  <note>
    <title>IBM Lotus Notes/Domino 8.5.3 의 @GetMachineInfo 함수를 사용하면undefined Notes 사용자 PC에 대한 다양한 정보</title>
    <created>20141215T024749Z</created>
    <updated>20141215T024800Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <source-url>
        http://www.techlearning.co.kr/search/label/IBM%20Notes%2FDomino%20%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C?updated-max=2013-02-14T10:10:00%2B09:00&amp;max-results=20&amp;start=321&amp;by-date=false
      </source-url>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">

<en-note style="word-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space;"><h3 style="margin: 0.75em 0px 0px; position: relative; font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;">IBM Lotus Notes/Domino 8.5.3 의&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">함수를 사용하면, Notes 사용자 PC에 대한 다양한 정보를 조회할 수가 있습니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">사용 문법은 다음과 같습니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo( [키워드]; &quot;일부 키워드에 필요한 문자열&quot; )</span></b><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">[키워드] :</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IsLaptop</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 사용자 PC가 랩탑인 경우 True (1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IsDesktop</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 사용자 PC가 랩탑이 아닌 경우 True (1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IsSingleLogOn</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: Notes 클라이언트에 &quot;단일 사인 온&quot; 기능이 설치된 경우 True(1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IsMultiUser</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 다중 사용자용 Notes 클라이언트가 설치된 경우 True(1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">HasDesigner</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: Domino Designer 가 설치된 경우 True(1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">HasAdmin</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: Domino Administrator 가 설치된 경우 True(1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IsStandard</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: Standard Notes 클라이언트가 설치된 경우 True(1), 그외의 경우에는 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">MachineName</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: PC 명을 반환.&nbsp;</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">만약 키워드 다음에 특정 PC명을 지정하여 일치하면 True(1), 그렇치 않으면 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예)&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo( [MachineName]; &quot;MyPC&quot; )</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">Memory</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 전체 메모리 (RAM) 크기 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">DiskSpace</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 여유 디스크 공간 크기 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">만약 키워드 다음에 특정 드라이브명을 지정하는 경우, 해당 드라이브의 여유 디스크 공간 크기 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예) @GetMachineInfo([DiskSpace];&quot;d:&quot;)</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">EnvVariable</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: NOTES.INI 의 특정 매개변수의 값 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예)&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo([EnvVariable];&quot;ContentLanguage&quot;)</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">SysEnvVariable</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: 시스템 환경변수의 값 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예) @GetMachineInfo([SysEnvVariable];&quot;Path&quot;)</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">IP</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: IP 주소 반환 (XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX 형식)</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">만약 키워드 다음에 특정 IP 주소를 지정하여 일치하면 True(1), 그렇치 않으면 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예) @GetMachineInfo( [IP]; &quot;192.168.123.103&quot; )</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">MAC</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;: MAC 주소 반환 (XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX 형식)</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">만약 키워드 다음에 특정 IP 주소를 지정하여 일치하면 True(1), 그렇치 않으면 False(0) 반환</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예) @GetMachineInfo( [MAC]; &quot;08:00:27:0F:59:6A&quot; )</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;함수는 또한 정책 설정 문서 작성시에도 사용될 수 있습니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">이전 버전에서, 정책은 개인에게만 적용되었지만&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;함수를 사용하면 개인이 사용하는 PC 의 상태에 따라 적용이 가능합니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">예를 들어, 데스크탑 설정 문서 작성시 &quot;Preferences&quot; 탭 --&gt; &quot;Replication&quot; 탭을 선택한 후 &quot;Encrypt replicas&quot; 필드값을 목록에서 선택하면, 다음 그림과 같이 &quot;Enter machine specific formula&quot; 라는 버튼이 표시됩니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;"><br/></span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/></h3><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center;"><h3 style="margin: 0.75em 0px 0px; position: relative; font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-em5b0MjNN8w/UQ9VTSnNTgI/AAAAAAAACMc/bfvmTW4sIoc/s1600/20142198476-10.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="777b2484b45993e7ee7285b484d23ee7" style="cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;"><br/></span><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;"><br/></span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;">해당 버튼을 클릭한 후, 다음 그림과 같이&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"><span style="font-family: 굴림;">@GetMachineInfo</span></b><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;">&nbsp;함수를 사용하여 수식을 작성한 후, &quot;Check Syntax&quot; 버튼을 클릭하여 작성한 수식의 오류를 검사할 수 있습니다.</span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;"><br/></span><br style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px;"/></h3><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; clear: both; text-align: center;"><h3 style="margin: 0.75em 0px 0px; position: relative; font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Kzjymbol28s/UQ9VTa5fSRI/AAAAAAAACMg/WoYkwPW2DcM/s1600/20142198476-20.gif" style="text-decoration: none; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;"><en-media border="0" hash="deca83d335de1a0e33523fa56c64f987" style="cursor: default;" type="image/gif"/></a><span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.4799995422363px; font-family: 굴림;"><br/></span></h3></div></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
